{"schema_version":1,"key":"dish-9e09ccc87f3f","reference_recipes":[{"id":"howtocook-9e09ccc87f3f","name":"电饭煲三文鱼炊饭","category":"staple","url":"https://github.com/Anduin2017/HowToCook/blob/0e106eea348c734fe1586f781202994439cf98a5/dishes/staple/%E7%94%B5%E9%A5%AD%E7%85%B2%E4%B8%89%E6%96%87%E9%B1%BC%E7%82%8A%E9%A5%AD/%E7%94%B5%E9%A5%AD%E7%85%B2%E4%B8%89%E6%96%87%E9%B1%BC%E7%82%8A%E9%A5%AD.md","blob_sha":"b82eacd686b894d531f4168f42872b2a9c268857","details":{"introduction":"这是一道融合日式炊饭做法的家常料理，米饭吸饱牛油和三文鱼的香气，口感浓郁鲜香。三文鱼提供优质蛋白和不饱和脂肪酸，搭配菌菇更添膳食纤维。操作极其简单，只需用电饭煲一键完成，从备料到出锅大约 45 分钟，非常适合新手尝试。","difficulty":"★★","sections":[{"heading":"必备原料和工具","markdown":"- 有盐牛油\n- 三文鱼\n- 米\n- 粟米（可选）\n- 金菇（可选）\n- 冬菇（可选）\n\n### 工具\n\n- 电饭煲"},{"heading":"计算","markdown":"- 米 50g / 人\n- 三文鱼 300g / 人\n- 水\n- 牛油一汤匙 / 人"},{"heading":"操作","markdown":"1. 三文鱼去鳞，去骨\n2. 金菇、冬菇切碎\n3. 洗米三次\n4. 把三文鱼、米、牛油放入电饭煲\n5. 想口感浓厚一点，可以加多一汤匙牛油\n6. 根据电饭煲的刻度放水\n7. 把电饭煲調較至煲飯模式，等待大約 30 - 45 分鐘"}]}}],"nutrition":{"status":"reference","basis":"per_100g","serving_g":null,"scope":"2–3人家庭标准配方估算：生短粒白米200g、三文鱼（大西洋养殖）250g、通用酱油（shoyu近似）20g、食盐3g、姜10g、饮用水500g；整份约950g。大西洋养殖三文鱼去骨净肉，短粒生米；不加其他可选调料，米汤全食。净量及成品重为明确标准假设，非实测；未做烹饪损失校正，所有列入的油糖酱均计入。","per_100g":{"energy_kcal":132.063158,"protein_g":6.927368,"carbohydrate_g":16.964842,"fat_g":3.655684},"source":{"name":"USDA FoodData Central","url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/168931/nutrients","version":"562bae93602c1e96","fdc_ids":[168931,175167,174277,173468,169231,173647]},"profile_id":"family-9e09ccc87f3f-v1","recipe_id":"howtocook-9e09ccc87f3f","review_status":"approved","method":"usda_recipe_estimate","recipe_basis":"standardized_assumptions","is_estimate":true,"match":{"food_identity":"howtocook-9e09ccc87f3f","state":"ready_to_eat","cooking_method":"braise","edible_part":"explicit_net_edible_ingredients_without_bones_shells_or_discarded_parts","oil_added":false,"sugar_added":false,"sauce_added":true,"brand":null,"variant":"family-9e09ccc87f3f-v1","standard_ingredients":[{"key":"rice_dry","grams":200},{"key":"salmon","grams":250},{"key":"soy","grams":20},{"key":"salt","grams":3},{"key":"ginger","grams":10},{"key":"water","grams":500}],"excludes":["不同主料、品种、品牌、用量、含水量或额外配料","带骨带壳毛重、丢弃汤汁或锅中残油的实际摄入计算","将家庭份成品重量假设当作实测或USDA出成率"]},"data_version":"562bae93602c1e96","completeness":"complete","rules_version":"nutrition-1.6.0","details":{"path":"assets/nutrition/family-9e09ccc87f3f-v1.8aeb7f58e2ababca.json","bytes":28548,"sha256":"8aeb7f58e2ababca5227d4806bce0751939270ed7984e32b9a2ab5ad8a253930"},"requires_independent_match":true},"nutrition_profiles":[{"id":"family-9e09ccc87f3f-v1","recipe_id":"howtocook-9e09ccc87f3f","recipe_blob_sha":"b82eacd686b894d531f4168f42872b2a9c268857","version":"1","data_version":"562bae93602c1e96","status":"reference","review_status":"approved","method":"usda_recipe_estimate","recipe_basis":"standardized_assumptions","estimate_confidence":"low","final_weight":{"grams":950,"method":"household_recipe_assumption","basis":"standard_recipe_assumption","is_measured":false,"servings":{"min":2,"max":3},"evidence":"项目按2–3人家庭份明确设定成品950g，非实测或USDA出成率；原料与成品重分别保存。"},"retention_correction":"not_applied","basis":"per_100g","completeness":"complete","scope":"2–3人家庭标准配方估算：生短粒白米200g、三文鱼（大西洋养殖）250g、通用酱油（shoyu近似）20g、食盐3g、姜10g、饮用水500g；整份约950g。大西洋养殖三文鱼去骨净肉，短粒生米；不加其他可选调料，米汤全食。净量及成品重为明确标准假设，非实测；未做烹饪损失校正，所有列入的油糖酱均计入。","match":{"food_identity":"howtocook-9e09ccc87f3f","state":"ready_to_eat","cooking_method":"braise","edible_part":"explicit_net_edible_ingredients_without_bones_shells_or_discarded_parts","oil_added":false,"sugar_added":false,"sauce_added":true,"brand":null,"variant":"family-9e09ccc87f3f-v1","standard_ingredients":[{"key":"rice_dry","grams":200},{"key":"salmon","grams":250},{"key":"soy","grams":20},{"key":"salt","grams":3},{"key":"ginger","grams":10},{"key":"water","grams":500}],"excludes":["不同主料、品种、品牌、用量、含水量或额外配料","带骨带壳毛重、丢弃汤汁或锅中残油的实际摄入计算","将家庭份成品重量假设当作实测或USDA出成率"]},"per_100g":{"energy_kcal":132.063158,"protein_g":6.927368,"carbohydrate_g":16.